# Terminals. Each line: what to call it, then where it comes from, best source first.
#   pacman:NAME[+NAME]  the system repositories      aur:NAME  an AUR recipe (reviewed before building)
#   mise:NAME           installed for your user through mise
# The first source that still exists is used; an entry with none left is not shown.
Ghostty	pacman:ghostty
Alacritty	pacman:alacritty
Kitty	pacman:kitty
Foot	pacman:foot
